{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical2</strong> is a turn-based strategy board game where two teams of ancient Greek deities clash across a 10x10 grid. Deploy your divine champions, control their movements, and unleash powerful abilities to outmaneuver your opponent. Each turn, you\u2019ll move two characters and perform two actions (attack, shield, and more) as you fight to cross into enemy territory. Victory goes to the first player to reach the opposite side of the board. Choose your gods wisely, master their powers, and claim your place among the legends.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822740?t=1756561986","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822740?t=1756561986","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822740/6dfe85edd2f18e954bd15ebd58bbac7bcf685668/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756561986","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822740/6dfe85edd2f18e954bd15ebd58bbac7bcf685668/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756561986","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game is about character combat, although there are no depiction of violence, gore or blood, the concept itself might be unsuitable for certain audiences."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical2</strong> is a turn-based strategy board game where two teams of ancient Greek deities clash across a 10x10 grid. Deploy your divine champions, control their movements, and unleash powerful abilities to outmaneuver your opponent. Each turn, you\u2019ll move two characters and perform two actions (attack, shield, and more) as you fight to cross into enemy territory. Victory goes to the first player to reach the opposite side of the board. Choose your gods wisely, m